<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2123750257"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1801484236"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="to be continued"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="早見沙織 / 東山奈央"/><amll:meta key="album" value="やはりこのキャラソンはまちがっている｡～10th Anniversary～"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:06.520"><div begin="00:21.388" end="03:57.204"><p begin="00:21.388" end="00:24.495" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">君は自転車を引いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你推着自行车与我一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha ji te n sha wo hi i te</span></p><p begin="00:24.555" end="00:27.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">並んで歩く帰り道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并肩走在回家的路上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ra n de a ru ku ka e ri mi chi</span></p><p begin="00:27.652" end="00:32.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">追いかけて来る 声に微笑んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对身后紧随而来的问候回以微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i ka ke te ku ru ko e ni ho ho e n da</span></p><p begin="00:34.026" end="00:36.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">何か探してたようで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛一直都有所寻觅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ka sa ga shi te ta yo u de</span></p><p begin="00:37.151" end="00:40.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">そこには全部詰まってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而那里早就被一切填满了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ni ha ze n bu tsu ma 't te ta</span></p><p begin="00:40.367" end="00:45.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">愛すべき切なさ分け合ってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们共享这份理应深爱的悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i su be ki se tsu na sa wa ke a 't te ta</span></p><p begin="00:46.415" end="00:47.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：Hello（你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello alone</span></p><p begin="00:47.252" end="00:48.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：（Hello 你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello alone</span></p><p begin="00:48.060" end="00:49.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：alone（落寞）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka ga so u u ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:49.347" end="00:52.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">誰かがそう歌って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知是谁如此歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka ga so u u ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:52.734" end="00:53.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：Hello（你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello again</span></p><p begin="00:53.617" end="00:54.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：（Hello 你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello again</span></p><p begin="00:54.337" end="00:55.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：again（再一次）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello again</span></p><p begin="00:55.689" end="00:58.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">私たちは そう言ってまた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我们能这样与彼此交谈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi ha so u i 't te ma ta</span></p><p begin="00:58.861" end="01:04.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">笑い合えるとしたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次相视而笑该有多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i a e ru to shi ta na ra</span></p><p begin="01:05.711" end="01:08.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Last forever（永世长存的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Last forever</span></p><p begin="01:08.258" end="01:11.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">君と繋いでくメロディー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那首旋律让我与你产生联系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to tsu na i de ku me ro di i</span></p><p begin="01:11.901" end="01:13.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">微妙なバランス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论是微妙的平衡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bi myo u na ba ra n su</span></p><p begin="01:13.521" end="01:15.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">曖昧なニュアンスも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是模棱两可的语调似乎都是如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma i na nyu a n su mo ra shi i yo ne</span></p><p begin="01:15.889" end="01:17.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">…らしいよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">...十分符合彼此呢</span></p><p begin="01:17.829" end="01:20.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">きっとLast forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定可以永远留存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to last forever</span></p><p begin="01:20.936" end="01:24.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">たとえ世界が変わっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕这个世界发生改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e se ka i ga ka wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:24.583" end="01:27.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">一緒にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍会彼此相伴 我喜欢这种感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="01:26.047" end="01:27.716" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">私が好き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：（深爱的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="01:27.716" end="01:34.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">この奇跡to be continued<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个奇迹将会谱写出美好的后续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki se ki to be continued</span></p><p begin="01:43.530" end="01:46.567" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">夢を見てる時には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">徜徉于梦境的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wo mi te ru to ki ni ha</span></p><p begin="01:46.604" end="01:49.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">これは夢だと気付かずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不曾察觉这是一场梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ha yu me da to ki zu ka zu ni</span></p><p begin="01:49.802" end="01:55.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">幸せな時 ただ身を預けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幸福降临时 只需切身去感受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se na to ki ta da mi wo a zu ke te</span></p><p begin="01:56.149" end="01:59.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">目醒めた時に感じる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从梦中醒来的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me ta to ki ni ka n ji ru</span></p><p begin="01:59.295" end="02:02.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">ほんの微かな さみしさは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受到的些许寂寞之情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n no ka su ka na sa mi shi sa ha</span></p><p begin="02:02.401" end="02:08.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">消えちゃうこと どこか知ってるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终会消弭殆尽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e cha u ko to</span></p><p begin="02:08.533" end="02:09.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：Hello（你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello alone</span></p><p begin="02:09.342" end="02:10.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：（Hello 你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello alone</span></p><p begin="02:10.142" end="02:11.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：alone（落寞）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ga 't te mi se ta 'k ke</span></p><p begin="02:11.379" end="02:14.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">強がってみせたっけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是不是在故作坚强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ga 't te mi se ta 'k ke</span></p><p begin="02:14.811" end="02:15.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：Hello（你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello again</span></p><p begin="02:15.705" end="02:16.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Hello<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：（Hello 你好）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello again</span></p><p begin="02:16.478" end="02:17.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：again（再一次）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha gu re na i de ha na re na i de</span></p><p begin="02:17.807" end="02:19.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">はぐれないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要与我走散 不要与我分离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha gu re na i de ha na re na i de</span></p><p begin="02:19.393" end="02:20.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">離れないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：别离开我</span></p><p begin="02:20.971" end="02:27.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">また歩き出そうEveryday world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们再次迈步于日常的世界吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a ru ki da so u everyday world</span></p><p begin="02:27.856" end="02:30.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Last forever（永世长存的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Last forever</span></p><p begin="02:30.438" end="02:33.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">君と重ねてくメモリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这段回忆将与你一同谱写</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ka sa ne te ku me mo ri i</span></p><p begin="02:33.982" end="02:35.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">青い潮風も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蔚蓝的海风也好 飘落的樱花雨也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o i shi o ka ze mo sa ku ra ni fu ru a me mo</span></p><p begin="02:35.586" end="02:37.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">桜に降る雨も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：漫天樱雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o i shi o ka ze mo sa ku ra ni fu ru a me mo</span></p><p begin="02:38.015" end="02:39.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">…大事だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是如此重要</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ji da ne</span></p><p begin="02:39.936" end="02:43.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">きっとLast forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定可以永远留存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to last forever</span></p><p begin="02:43.066" end="02:46.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">たとえ世界が変わっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕这个世界发生改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e se ka i ga ka wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="02:46.624" end="02:49.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">一緒にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍会彼此相伴 我喜欢这种感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="02:48.159" end="02:49.714" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">私が好き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃：（深爱的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="02:49.763" end="02:54.898" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">この奇跡to be continued<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个奇迹将会谱写出美好的后续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki se ki to be continued</span></p><p begin="03:05.691" end="03:08.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪之下雪乃&amp;由比滨结衣：Last forever（永世长存的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Last forever</span></p><p begin="03:08.261" end="03:11.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">君と繋いでくメロディー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那首旋律让我与你产生联系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to tsu na i de ku me ro di i</span></p><p begin="03:11.928" end="03:15.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">外れてるようで チグハグみたいでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛总事与愿违</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha zu re te ru yo u de</span></p><p begin="03:15.832" end="03:17.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">ハーモニナイズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍不会显得违和</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha a mo ni na i zu</span></p><p begin="03:17.864" end="03:20.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">きっとLast forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定可以永远留存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to last forever</span></p><p begin="03:20.975" end="03:24.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">たとえ世界が変わっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕这个世界发生改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e se ka i ga ka wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:24.517" end="03:27.405" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">一緒にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍会彼此相伴 我喜欢这种感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="03:26.108" end="03:27.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">私が好き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由比滨结衣：（深爱的）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ru wa ta shi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="03:27.663" end="03:34.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">この奇跡to be continued<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个奇迹将会谱写出美好的后续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki se ki to be continued</span></p><p begin="03:37.140" end="03:42.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">何もかもが 淡く輝いてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间万物都闪烁着微光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo ka mo ga a wa ku ka ga ya i te ta</span></p><p begin="03:40.767" end="03:43.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">ダイヤモンドみたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像是钻石那样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ya mo n do mi ta i</span></p><p begin="03:43.543" end="03:46.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">このラブコメ 間違ってないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这部爱情喜剧本就毋庸置疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ra bu ko me ma chi ga 't te na i yo</span></p><p begin="03:46.498" end="03:57.204" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">したがって 終わりは来ないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因如此才会永远继续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ta ga 't te o wa ri ha ko na i no</span></p></div></body></tt>